# Issue Framework — Stage Agents (locked)

**Authority:** User-locked 2026-07-11; **stage map + auto-chain revised 2026-07-22** (Grok 4.5 all stages; stops only at Development approval and after Validation); **Stage 0 Discovery locked 2026-08-01** (Search & Discuss before Intake). **Do not change unless the user manually overrides in chat or edits this rule / `AI_Agents/Framework.md`.**

## Linear stage order

| Stage | Agent | Code allowed? | Assigned model |
|-------|--------|---------------|----------------|
| 0 | Discovery | **No** | Cursor Grok 4.5 |
| 1 | Intake | **No** | Cursor Grok 4.5 |
| 2 | Planning | **No** | Cursor Grok 4.5 |
| 3 | Dependency Gate | **No** | Cursor Grok 4.5 |
| 4 | Risk | **No** | Cursor Grok 4.5 |
| 5 | Development | **Yes** (surgical only) | Cursor Grok 4.5 |
| 6 | Validation | Read-only + scripts | Cursor Grok 4.5 |
| 7 | Regression | Read-only + batch/compare | Cursor Grok 4.5 |
| 8 | Closure | Docs only | Cursor Grok 4.5 |

## Auto-chains (default — Stage 0 locked 2026-08-01)

### Discovery (on issue open)

**Discovery (Search & Discuss)** → then **stop**.

Discuss what needs to be done (repo/source/UI target). Do **not** start Intake until the user says e.g. “Proceed to Intake”.

**Opt-out:** “Skip Discovery” / open with “Proceed to Intake” → skip Stage 0.

### Pre-Development Auto-Chain (after Proceed to Intake)

**Intake → Planning → Dependency Gate → Risk** → then **stop**.

Report Risk Go/No-Go findings and **ask for Development approval**. Do **not** start Development until the user says e.g. “Approved for Development”.

### Post-Development Auto-Chain (after Dev approval)

**Development → Validation** → then **stop**.

Report Validation PASS/FAIL. Do **not** auto-run Regression/Closure yet.

### Post-Validation Auto-Chain (after Validation PASS)

When Validation **PASS**es (or user says validation is complete / proceed to Closure):

**Regression → Closure** (including G7 Output accountability gate).

**Opt-out:** “Discovery only” → stop after Discovery. “Intake only” / “stop after Intake” → stop after Intake. Dependency Gate **BLOCKED** → stop; do not Risk.

## Enforcement

1. Use Cursor Grok 4.5 for **all** stages unless the user overrides.
2. Discovery → Risk: **no production code**.
3. Opening an issue triggers **Discovery** first (then stop) unless the user opts out / skips Discovery.
4. After “Proceed to Intake”, run Intake → Risk, then stop for Development approval.
5. Development requires G1 + G2 + G3 **and** explicit Development approval.
6. After Development approval, run Development then Validation, then stop for the Validation readout.
7. After Validation PASS, continue Regression → Closure in the same session (or when user confirms).
8. Canonical copy: `AI_Agents/Framework.md` — keep both in sync.
9. **G7 Closure Output gate:** do **not** mark **Closed** until issue validator PASS on full `QLA_Migration/Output/` and accountability **IN_DATA** (see `.cursor/rules/issue-closure-output-gate.mdc`).

